BT /F1 10 Tf 54 701 Td (Policy code: POL-FIN-015. Owner: Finance, in partnership with Reward. Effective date: 1 July) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 688 Td (2024. Applies to: employees of Meridian Instruments Ltd employed in the United Kingdom only.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 675 Td (Employees in Rotterdam, Austin and Penang are covered by local arrangements and are not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 662 Td (eligible under this policy.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 637 Td (1. Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 615 Td (This policy sets out who is eligible for a car allowance or a company car, how the electric) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 602 Td (company car scheme works, and how employees who receive car support claim business mileage. It) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 589 Td (supports Meridian's commitment to reduce fleet emissions by moving all new company cars to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 576 Td (fully electric vehicles.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 551 Td (2. Car allowance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 529 Td (A cash car allowance is paid to UK employees in the following grades:) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 508 Td (Grade | Annual car allowance) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 496 Td (G6\226G7 | \2435,400) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 484 Td (G8\226G9 | \2437,800) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 472 Td (G10 | \24310,200) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 450 Td (The allowance is paid monthly through payroll in twelve equal instalments, is subject to tax) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 437 Td (and National Insurance, and is not pensionable. It is pro-rated for part-time employees and for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 424 Td (employees who join or change grade part-way through the year. Grades are defined in the Grade) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 411 Td (Structure, Salary Ranges and Bonus Targets document.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 389 Td (Employees receiving the allowance must have a roadworthy vehicle available for business use,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 376 Td (hold a full UK driving licence, and hold business-use insurance. Evidence of insurance must be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 363 Td (uploaded to Keel each year.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 338 Td (3. Electric company car scheme) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 316 Td (Field sales roles at grade G4 and above, and other roles where the job requires more than 8,000) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 303 Td (business miles a year, may choose a company car instead of the allowance where they are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 290 Td (eligible.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 268 Td (- All new company cars are fully electric. Hybrid and petrol or diesel vehicles are not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 255 Td (   offered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 242 Td (- The vehicle list price cap is \24345,000 including options and VAT.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 229 Td (- Employees may pay for a vehicle above the cap through a monthly salary deduction for the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 216 Td (   difference, subject to Finance approval.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 203 Td (- Leases run for 48 months or 80,000 miles.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 190 Td (- Meridian pays for the lease, insurance, maintenance, tyres and breakdown cover.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 177 Td (- Benefit-in-kind tax is the responsibility of the employee.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 164 Td (Employees who choose a company car do not receive the car allowance. A switch between allowance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 151 Td (and car is only possible at lease end or on a change of role.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 126 Td (4. Home charging) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 104 Td (Company car drivers may have a home charger installed. Meridian reimburses the cost of home) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 91 Td (charger installation up to \2431,000, claimed once through Atlas > Expenses > New Claim with the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 78 Td (installer's invoice. Any cost above \2431,000 is paid by the employee. The charger remains the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 65 Td (employee's property.) Tj ET
