BT /F1 9 Tf 54 612 Td (Advisory Electric Rate) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 600 Td (No car allowance, own car | Standard rate in POL-FIN-007) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 578 Td (Employees who receive a car allowance or a company car must not claim the standard private car) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 565 Td (mileage rate set out in the Travel and Expense Policy \(POL-FIN-007\). The allowance already) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 552 Td (contributes to the cost of owning and running the car, so only the fuel or electricity element) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 539 Td (is reimbursed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 517 Td (The current HMRC Advisory Fuel Rates and Advisory Electric Rate are published monthly in Atlas) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 504 Td (and are applied automatically when the employee selects "Mileage \226 car allowance" or "Mileage \226) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 491 Td (company car" in the claim. Mileage must be supported by a mileage log \(form F-207 or the Atlas) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 478 Td (mileage log\) showing date, start and end points, purpose and miles.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 456 Td (Ordinary commuting between home and the employee's normal workplace is not business mileage.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 431 Td (6. Driver responsibilities) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 409 Td (- Hold a valid licence and report any endorsement or disqualification to Finance within 5) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 396 Td (   working days.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 383 Td (- Never drive while using a hand-held phone or under the influence of alcohol or drugs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 370 Td (- Report accidents to the fleet provider and to Finance within 24 hours.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 357 Td (- Pay any fines or penalty charges incurred while driving.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 344 Td (Licences are checked annually by Finance using the DVLA online service with the driver's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 331 Td (consent.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 306 Td (7. Leaving Meridian) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 284 Td (Company cars must be returned on or before the last working day. Early termination charges on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 271 Td (the lease may be recovered from the employee if they resign within the first 12 months of a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 258 Td (lease, except where local law does not allow it. The car allowance stops from the leaving date.) Tj ET
